  "rewardData": "Acorn Charm__€11.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Early Bird Acorn Cookies__€11.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Acorn Cookies & Initiative__€15.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Early Bird Cookies & Charm__€18.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Cookies & Charm__€22.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Cookies & Healing Oil__€28.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | 3 X Acorn Cookies (share!)__€36.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | T-Shirt, Cookies & Charm!__€44.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Watermelon BBQ,Cookies & Charm__€60.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Early Bird 8 X Cookies__€84.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Apron, Cookies & Charm__€92.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | 3 Day Kea Getaway__€150.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | 1 Week Kean Getaway__€500.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | PATRON Status__€1,000.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Kean Immortality__€3,000.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | ",
